Mniaceae is a moss family in the order Bryales.

Taxonomy

The family Mniaceae includes the following genera:

 Cinclidium {{small|[[Sw.]]}}
 Cyrtomnium {{small|Holmen}}
 Epipterygium {{small|[[Lindb.]]}} 
 Leucolepis {{small|[[Lindb.]]}}
 Mielichhoferia {{small|Nees & Hornsch.}}
 Mnium {{small|[[Hedw.]]}}
 Orthomnion {{small|Wilson}}
 Plagiomnium {{small|[[T. J. Koponen]]}}
 Pohlia {{small|Hedw.}}
 Pseudobryum {{small|([[Kindb.]]) T. J. Koponen}}
 Pseudopohlia {{small|R. S. Williams}}
 Rhizomnium {{small|([[Broth.]]) T. J. Koponen}}
 Schizymenium {{small|[[Harv.]]}}
 Synthetodontium {{small|Cardot}}
 Trachycystis {{small|Lindberg}}{{clarify|reason=Flora of North America gives Lindb. as authority; Goffinet's book and web versions give T. J. Kop|date=May 2020}}
